note cg_bind owns canonical encodings; this unit only hashes its 256-byte wire.
note Compose with om/cache/digest.om. No duplicated identity admission or encoding.
fn bw_identity data view uchar 256 n ulong out edit uchar 32 to int
if gt n 256
ret -1
end
msg = new uchar 4096 0
for i ulong n
put msg i get data i
end
ret kc_sha msg n out
end
